---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About DealyVIP" description="Practical cross-border business assistance, verification, and sourcing." lang="en">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: var(--space-xl); padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
    
    <h1 class="display-title" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">About DealyVIP</h1>
    
    <div style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-slate-800);">
      <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        Cross-border business should not rely on blind trust. When you engage with companies, suppliers, or partners in foreign jurisdictions, public information is often opaque, and local realities are complex.
      </p>
      
      <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        DealyVIP was founded to bridge the gap between remote due diligence and on-the-ground reality. We provide independent research, verification of available information, sourcing, and local coordination.
      </p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); font-size: 1.5rem;">Our Core Principles</h2>
      
      <ul style="padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Factual Evidence:</strong> We rely on primary registries, public records, and physical local checks where necessary.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Honest Boundaries:</strong> We do not provide magical guarantees. If a risk cannot be eliminated, we tell you.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Practical Utility:</strong> We go beyond high-level consulting by actually coordinating the specific task you need done.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); font-size: 1.5rem;">Where We Operate</h2>
      
      <p style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        Our current coverage focuses on complex markets where remote verification frequently fails: <strong>Türkiye, Ukraine, Russia, and Iran</strong>. We maintain local networks capable of navigating the unique bureaucratic, linguistic, and operational challenges of these environments.
      </p>

    </div>
  </div>

  <CTASection 
    title="Discuss your project" 
    text="Tell us what you need. We'll outline how we can assist." 
    btnText="Start your request" 
    btnUrl="/en/contact/" 
  />
</BaseLayout>
